      "description": "Named action with shared control corners, a 44px target and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<button dir=\"rtl\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">שמירה</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:var(--sans,'Noto Sans Hebrew',sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .95rem;border:1px solid var(--accent,#126B78);border-radius:var(--radius,8px);background:var(--accent,#126B78);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background .14s ease,border-color .14s ease;}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-hover,#0C5360);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);border-color:var(--accent-hover,#0C5360);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none;}}"
