      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "summary",
      "description": "White primary values and aligned separators; placeholders avoid copying live measurements.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-summary\" dir=\"rtl\" aria-label=\"מדדים מרכזיים\"><article><span>מבקרים משוערים</span><strong>—</strong></article><article><span>ביקורים</span><strong>—</strong></article><article><span>צפיות</span><strong>—</strong></article></section>",
      "css": ".ds-summary{font-family:var(--sans,'Noto Sans Hebrew',sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);}.ds-summary article{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;padding:1rem 1.3rem;border-inline-end:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-summary article:last-child{border-inline-end:0;}.ds-summary span{color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:400;}.ds-summary strong{font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-summary article{padding:.8rem .65rem;gap:.35rem;}.ds-summary span{font-size:.71rem;min-height:2.1rem;}.ds-summary strong{font-size:1.75rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Period Selector",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "period-selected",
      "description": "An explicit filled period state, distinct from the underline toggles used within data panels.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-period\" dir=\"rtl\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"טווח זמן\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">24 שעות</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">7 ימים</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">30 יום</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">90 יום</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-period{font-family:var(--sans,'Noto Sans Hebrew',sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;gap:1px;padding:3px;background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:10px;}.ds-period button{min-height:44px;padding:.3rem .75rem;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;}.ds-period button:hover{background:var(--paper-deep,#EAF0F6);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);}.ds-period button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--accent,#126B78);color:var(--on-accent,#FFFFFF);}.ds-period button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-period{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;}.ds-period button{padding-inline:.5rem;}}@media(max-width:380px){.ds-period button{padding-inline:.3rem;font-size:.7rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Site Comparison",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A generic zero-data example with one aligned header, neutral change and a zero-fill measured activity bar.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-comparison\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"ds-comparison-head\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>אתר</span><span>אומדן</span><span>ביקורים</span><span>צפיות</span><span class=\"ds-comparison-change\">שינוי</span><span></span></div><a class=\"ds-comparison-row\" href=\"#example\" aria-label=\"אתר לדוגמה, אומדן 0, ביקורים 0, צפיות 0, אין קודמים\"><b class=\"ds-comparison-name\">אתר לדוגמה</b><strong>0</strong><span class=\"ds-comparison-activity\"><strong>0</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"><em></em></i></span><strong>0</strong><span class=\"ds-comparison-change\">אין קודמים</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-comparison{font-family:var(--sans,'Noto Sans Hebrew',sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:var(--panel-radius,12px);background:var(--paper-light,#FFFFFF);color:var(--ink,#1D2B3D);overflow:hidden;}.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(9rem,1.65fr) repeat(3,minmax(4rem,.8fr)) minmax(7rem,1fr) 1rem;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;padding-inline:1.1rem;}.ds-comparison-head{padding-block:.65rem;background:var(--paper-deep,#EAF0F6);color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);font-size:.73rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#D7E0EA);}.ds-comparison-row{min-height:56px;padding-block:.7rem;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-comparison-row:hover{background:var(--row-hover,#F0F8F9);}.ds-comparison-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#126B78);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:.9rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-comparison-row strong{font-size:1.12rem;}.ds-comparison-activity{display:grid;gap:.3rem;justify-items:start;}.ds-comparison-activity i{display:block;width:3.5rem;max-width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--line,#D7E0EA);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-comparison-activity em{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:var(--accent,#126B78);}.ds-comparison-change{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);}.ds-comparison-row>svg{color:var(--ink-muted,#536479);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(3,2.85rem) .6rem;gap:.3rem;padding-inline:.7rem;}.ds-comparison-head{font-size:.67rem;}.ds-comparison-head>span:not(:first-child){text-align:center;}.ds-comparison-head .ds-comparison-change{display:none;}.ds-comparison-row{min-height:72px;row-gap:.3rem;}.ds-comparison-name{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;}.ds-comparison-row>strong,.ds-comparison-activity{grid-row:1/3;text-align:center;justify-self:center;}.ds-comparison-row>strong:nth-child(2){grid-column:2;}.ds-comparison-activity{grid-column:3;justify-items:center;}.ds-comparison-row>strong:nth-child(4){grid-column:4;}.ds-comparison-row strong{font-size:1.05rem;}.ds-comparison-activity i{width:2rem;height:3px;}.ds-comparison-row .ds-comparison-change{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;font-size:.68rem;}.ds-comparison-row>svg{grid-column:5;grid-row:1/3;width:13px;}}@media(max-width:380px){.ds-comparison-head,.ds-comparison-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) repeat(3,2.55rem) .6rem;gap:.2rem;padding-inline:.55rem;}.ds-comparison-head{font-size:.64rem;}.ds-comparison-name{font-size:.76rem;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "חדר בקרה חד וברור",
    "overview": "A compact fleet console makes website activity and server attention easy to scan. Porcelain canvas, white data surfaces, slate navigation and petrol actions put aligned numbers and useful controls first. Short Hebrew nouns, contextual icons and explanations on demand keep the interface practical for a daily check.\n\nWebsite activity, client follow-up, services, settings and authentication share the light system. Infrastructure uses graphite surfaces with the same components, density and interaction grammar. The code-led concept is recorded in [the HTML brief](frontend/index.html) with seed `303d0dc4`; there is no separate approved image composition or generated visual asset.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Hebrew RTL, Noto Sans Hebrew and aligned tabular numbers.",
      "White summaries, tables and plots with subtle boundaries and gently rounded panels.",
      "Stable slate navigation, petrol actions and functional green, amber and red states.",
      "Compact comparison rows, measured activity bars and explanations on demand."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Meaningful Color Rule",
        "body": "Reserve strong color for actions, selection and operational states. Traffic changes stay neutral; ordinary visitor values use ink.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Family Rule",
        "body": "Build hierarchy with size, weight and alignment. Keep titles compact and omit display type and page eyebrows.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Data Rule",
        "body": "Keep data surfaces free of decorative shadows. Use elevation only for overlays that need to sit above another surface.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep numbers, dates and controls visible before explanatory copy.",
      "**Do** compose screens from shared components and local surface/status tokens.",
      "**Do** verify desktop and mobile layouts, keyboard focus, 44px targets and readable contrast.",
      "**Do** retain source distinctions, failures and measurement uncertainty in concise Hebrew.",
      "**Do** keep infrastructure graphite and email presentation separately grounded in their source."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore charcoal summaries or plots to the light workspace, square panel rules or a dark login treatment.",
      "**Don't** add decorative animation, gradients, glass, glow, page eyebrows, decorative badges or new visual libraries.",
      "**Don't** repeat metric icons or explanatory paragraphs in each row.",
      "**Don't** imply that an estimate is a confirmed person, a click is an inquiry or a traffic change is a business outcome.",
      "**Don't** introduce tracking or database behavior merely to support a visual redesign."
    ]
  }
}
